      "created_at": "2021-11-21T13:05:32.144Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think if you only have 1 destroyed presence, you get that, but if you have 2 or more, you can’t just add 1, hence the wording.</p>\n<p>I <em>think</em> that’s the case, anyway, I don’t play digital often enough to really be well versed in the nitty-gritty of SI mechanics, so someone can back me up here.</p>",
