      "created_at": "2021-11-21T15:30:02.560Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, “do as much as you can” applies. If you have only 1 destroyed presence, then you add that. If you have 2 or more, you add 2.</p>\n<p>From the rulebook:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>GENERAL PRINCIPLE: DO AS MUCH AS YOU CAN<br>\nWhen resolving a Power’s effects, do as much as you can. If one part does not apply or cannot be done, skip it and do the rest. The only targeting restrictions are those in the target bar.</p>\n</blockquote>",
